@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Team and Contact Role Deletion API
	Testing Koroneiki Account API functionality in relation to Contact Role deletion.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Deletion |
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Team Deletion Role  |
	* I tear down the teams on koroneiki with the following names
	| Deletion Team |

Scenario: Delete team and team contact and team contact role after team contact and contact role assignment
	Koroneiki teams should be able to be deleted after team contact and contact role assignment.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                 |
	| Language      | English                                   |
	| Last Name     | Deletion1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                      |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default deletion role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Deletion Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                        |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORDEL                             | |
	| Description  | Test deletion account on koroneiki | |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                       | |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Deletion                 | |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                       | |
	| Region       | United States                      | |
	| Status       | Active                             | |
	| Tier         | T4                                 | |
	| Website      | www.koroneikideletion.com          | |
	And I assign customer contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Deletion"
	| koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I create a team with the name "Deletion Team" for the account "Koroneiki Deletion"
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Deletion Team"
	| koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the team "Deletion Team" to the following roles	
	| Default Team Deletion Role |
	And I delete a koroneiki team with the name "Deletion Team"
	And I delete a contact role on koroneiki with the name "Default Team Deletion Role"
	And I delete a contact on koroneiki with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team with the name "Deletion Team"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Deletion Role"